%% SADITA.ai — Sequence Diagram Admin: Setup Akademik & Perangkat

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ADM as 🛡️ Admin
    participant FE as 🌐 Frontend
    participant BE as ⚙️ Backend
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database
    participant AUDIT as 📝 AuditLog

    Note over ADM, DB: ── Login & Setup Program Studi ──
    ADM->>FE: Masukkan email & password
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    BE->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>BE: User(role=ADMIN)
    BE-->>FE: {token, user, redirect: "/admin/dashboard"}
    FE-->>ADM: Dashboard Admin

    ADM->>FE: Buat Program Studi baru
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/prodi
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO program_studi
    BE->>AUDIT: Log(action="CREATE", entity="ProgramStudi")
    DB-->>BE: ProgramStudi created
    BE-->>FE: 201 Created

    Note over ADM, DB: ── Setup Semester & Mata Kuliah ──
    ADM->>FE: Buat Semester Ganjil 2026/2027
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/terms
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO academic_terms
    BE-->>FE: AcademicTerm created

    ADM->>FE: Buat Mata Kuliah (IF201 - Basis Data)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/courses
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO courses (prodi_id, kode, nama, sks)
    BE-->>FE: Course created

    Note over ADM, DB: ── Setup Kelas & Enrollment ──
    ADM->>FE: Buat Kelas TI-2024-IF201-PAGI-A
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/classes
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO course_classes
    BE-->>FE: CourseClass created

    ADM->>FE: Daftarkan 30 mahasiswa ke kelas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/academic/classes/{id}/enroll
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO class_enrollments (batch)
    BE-->>FE: Enrollment success (30 students)

    ADM->>FE: Tugaskan Ketua Kelas
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/workflow/class-leaders
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO class_leader_assignments
    BE->>AUDIT: Log(action="ASSIGN_LEADER")
    BE-->>FE: Leader assigned

    Note over ADM, DB: ── Setup Perangkat IoT ──
    ADM->>FE: Daftarkan ESP32 ke Ruangan R301
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/devices
    BE->>DB: INSERT INTO sadita_devices
    BE->>AUDIT: Log(action="REGISTER_DEVICE")
    BE-->>FE: Device registered

    ADM->>FE: Lihat Audit Log
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/audit/logs?limit=50
    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM audit_logs ORDER BY created_at DESC
    DB-->>BE: List AuditLog entries
    BE-->>FE: Audit log data
    FE-->>ADM: Tabel log aktivitas
